<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn feedlot cattle not well tested  - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn feedlot cattle not well tested  - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested on a live basis, compared with Wednesday's close, USDA said. Heifers were not well tested with steers not tested on a carcass basis.</p>
<p>Heifers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1150 lbs ld 105.00. Reported sales for Thursday: 100 Week to Date: 37,000</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
